---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import FAQSchema from "../../../components/FAQSchema.astro";
import ServiceVideoProof from "../../../components/ServiceVideoProof.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Upholstery Cleaning in La Prairie | Sofa, Sectional, Modular Seating"
  description="In-home upholstery cleaning in La Prairie for sofas, sectionals, modular seating, armchairs and banquettes. Practical regular care for family homes and quiet residential neighborhoods."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Sofa, Sectional and Upholstery Cleaning in La Prairie</h1>
      <p>
        In La Prairie, family living rooms see daily use: sectionals for evening routines, modular sofas, reading armchairs and banquettes around shared spaces. Our in-home
        service helps keep these seating areas clean, comfortable and ready for everyday life.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:5148939939">(514) 893-9939</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section svp-section-wrap">
    <div class="container">
      <ServiceVideoProof
        title="See our work in action"
        subtitle="Real cleaning of a stained sofa in Saint-Bruno-de-Montarville"
        description="Watch a full in-home job and see our professional method, specialized equipment, and the results after cleaning."
        youtubeId="auWtvSvqucg"
        youtubeTitle="Stained sofa cleaning in Saint-Bruno-de-Montarville"
        allVideosHref="/en/video-gallery/"
        videoAspectRatio="9 / 16"
        playLabel="Watch the video"
        allVideosLabel="See all our projects"
        closeLabel="Close video"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-light">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2>Local Upholstery Service in La Prairie</h2>
      <p>
        We provide upholstery cleaning built for family homes in La Prairie. Each visit follows a clear process: fabric inspection, appropriate method selection and careful
        execution for a reliable result that fits your routine.
      </p>

      <h2>Why Regular Upholstery Care Matters</h2>
      <p>
        Daily use naturally brings fine dust, body oils, light odors and small stains into fabric seating. Regular professional cleaning helps preserve comfort, appearance and
        long-term furniture condition.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Professional Cleaning Method</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Fabric inspection and method confirmation before cleaning.</li>
        <li>Targeted pre-treatment with professional fiber-appropriate shampoo.</li>
        <li>Steam cleaning through hot water extraction with truck-mount power.</li>
        <li>Protection of floors and circulation zones during service.</li>
        <li>Careful extraction for faster drying, typically between 2 and 6 hours.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Furniture We Clean</h2>
      <p>
        We clean sectional sofas, modular sofas, loveseats, upholstered armchairs, banquettes, ottomans and fabric chairs. Each item is treated according to upholstery type
        and real daily usage.
      </p>

      <h2>Specialized Treatments Available</h2>
      <p>
        When needed, we can add targeted stain removal, odor neutralization, enzymatic treatment and optional fabric protection. Recommendations are always practical and based
        on actual furniture condition.
      </p>

      <h2>Why Families in La Prairie Choose Empire</h2>
      <p>
        With over 30 years of experience, we deliver dependable in-home service with eco-friendly products and consistent execution. Families choose us for straightforward,
        reliable care that supports everyday comfort.
      </p>

      <h2>La Prairie FAQ</h2>
      <FAQSchema
        faqs={[
          {
            question: "Can you clean a large sectional and a banquette in one appointment?",
            answer:
              "Yes. We can plan one visit to cover your main seating pieces with a consistent cleaning approach and balanced final result.",
          },
          {
            question: "Is this service suitable for furniture used heavily by families?",
            answer:
              "Absolutely. Our process is designed for high-use household seating and supports ongoing comfort, hygiene and fabric appearance.",
          },
          {
            question: "How long before we can use the furniture again?",
            answer:
              "Drying time depends on fabric and ventilation, but most upholstery is ready within about 2 to 6 hours.",
          },
        ]}
      />

      <h2>Request an Estimate</h2>
      <p>
        For a quick quote on sofa, sectional, modular seating, armchair or banquette cleaning in La Prairie, contact Empire Cleaning Group at (514) 893-9939.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
